  m_text: "After you finish the educational section, one of my colleagues will meet
    you with further instructions about how to complete the brief quiz at the end
    of this game.  \n\nYou'll need to answer at least 3 out of 5 questions correctly.
    By this time, your loved one should be back in their room and ready for your
    visit.\n\nThank you for taking the time to learn more about this important health
    condition."
