  m_text: "As you progress through the game, you\u2019ll discover:\n\nWhat an Aneurysm
    Is:\_We\u2019ll explain what an aneurysm is, why it happens, and the common types
    you should be aware of.\n\nAnatomy Made Simple:\_You\u2019ll also get familiar
    with the aorta and major blood vessels through easy-to-understand visuals, which
    will really help demystify things!\n\nRecognizing the Signs:\_Finally, we\u2019ll
    cover the warning signs and risk factors for aneurysms, so you feel empowered
    to look after your loved one\u2019s health."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
